WEBVTT

00:01.840 --> 00:09.840
All these years, I have lived outside the palace. It was Eldest Brother who attended to Mother—this pastry rightly belongs to Eldest Brother.

00:20.280 --> 00:24.000
Later on, I shall bake several more boxes and have them sent to your residence.

00:24.000 --> 00:26.500
Of course, the elder boy will have his share as well!

00:30.400 --> 00:32.400
Your son thanks Imperial Mother!
